{"last_link_id": 61, "nodes": [{"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [18], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "color": "#844f00", "widgets_values": ["A cinematic rain-soaked night street scene rendered edge-to-edge in a 9:16 vertical crop, one continuous image reaching all four edges with no inset, no picture mount, no letterbox and no border of any kind. A narrow city street after heavy rain: wet asphalt carries long vertical reflections, shallow puddles gather at the kerb, tall shopfronts and hanging plastic awnings crowd both sides in near-silhouette, a service pole with coiled cables stands to one side and distant headlights smear into horizontal streaks; neon signage appears only as abstract glowing colour panels and striped tubes with no letters and no logos. The far end of the street falls into soft focus with overlapping magenta and pale-cyan light panels, a row of striped light tubes along an awning edge and one bright cool-white lamp above the pavement, all glow abstract with no readable characters, no brand marks and no lens flare. A clear plastic umbrella fills the upper middle of the image, its wet surface beaded with rain and catching magenta and cool-white highlights in broken curves, ribs faintly visible, water dripping from two tips. Beneath it a young Chinese woman in her late twenties walks toward the camera, seen from slightly below in three-quarter view, one hand gripping the umbrella shaft and the other in her coat pocket, chin slightly lowered but eyes lifting toward the viewer; fair cool-toned skin lit by magenta from one side and cool white from the other, dark hair loose and wet at the ends with a few strands stuck to her cheek, a calm confident expression with a faint smile; she wears a charcoal wool overcoat worn open over a fitted black knit top and a thin silver necklace, dark trousers and wet ankle boots, the coat collar turned up against the rain - adult, poised and quietly alluring without excess, cropped at the knees and filling most of the image height. The palette is deep indigo black, cool white and neon magenta, with clean surfaces, controlled highlights, no colour clutter, no lens flare, no gradients banding and no digital noise. The lower third falls into deep shadow and carries a small cool-white label reading \"ComfyUI\" above the main title, a very large bold condensed cool-white line reading \"MOSS-Image SFT 4-Steps\" filling the full width of its line, and a single neon-magenta hairline rule with a tiny square at its tip beneath it. Each string appears exactly once, with no extra copy and no logo. Edge-to-edge 1008x1792 vertical crop.\n"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 28, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 61, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#ffc36a", "size": [210, 270], "pos": [4010, 3160], "id": 4, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.3", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [19], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "color": "#844f00", "widgets_values": ["nsfw, worst quality, bad anatomy, watermark, jpeg, "], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 29, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#ffc36a", "size": [210, 120], "pos": [4010, 3480], "id": 5, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.3", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8